IDEAS BOX SUSTAINABLE USE LICENSE — English reference translation
(the Spanish version above governs)

1. Acceptance. By downloading, installing, using, copying, modifying or
   distributing the software, you agree to these terms.

2. Grant. The licensors grant you a free, worldwide, non-exclusive,
   non-transferable license to use, copy, install, modify and create
   derivative works of the software, subject to section 3.

3. Limitations.
   a) Internal use. You may use the software only for your own internal
      business or organizational purposes, or for personal or non-commercial
      use.
   b) No resale. You may not sell, resell, rent, sublicense or charge in any
      way for the software, a modified version or a derivative work. This
      includes distributing it for a fee or as part of a paid product,
      offering it to third parties as a hosted or managed service, and
      charging to install, configure or maintain it for third parties, unless
      you hold a current written partner license from the licensors.
   c) Free distribution. You may share copies, modified or not, only free of
      charge, for non-commercial purposes, and with this full license.
   d) Notices. You may not remove, alter or obscure license, copyright or
      trademark notices.

4. What you create is yours. Everything you produce using the software —
   text, images, videos, quotes, reports, documents, code for your own
   projects and any other output or deliverable— belongs to you, and you may
   use and sell it freely. Section 3 applies to the software itself, not to
   what you create with it, nor to selling your own services performed with
   the software in your business.

5. Commercial extensions. The licensors may offer paid connectors, skills,
   AI models and other extensions under separate licenses. This license grants
   no rights over them.

6. Trademarks. No rights are granted over "Ideas Box", "IdeasDevOps",
   "Disruptia AI" or their logos, except to identify the origin of the
   software without altering notices.

7. Third-party software. Skill packs, connectors and programs that Ideas Box
   downloads and installs are governed by their own licenses
   (see docs/TERCEROS.md).

8. Patents. Patent rights, if any, are licensed only as needed for the
   permitted use. If you claim the software infringes a patent, this license
   ends immediately.

9. Termination. This license ends automatically if you breach it. On a first
   breach, it is reinstated if you cure it within 30 days of notice;
   otherwise you must stop using the software and delete your copies.

10. No warranty, no liability. The software is provided "as is", without
    warranty of any kind. To the maximum extent permitted by law, the
    licensors are not liable for any damages arising from its use or
    inability to use it, including the actions of AI models it operates.

11. Earlier versions. Versions published before this license under the GNU
    Affero General Public License v3.0 remain under that license for those
    who already obtained them.

12. Definitions. "Software": Ideas Box in this version, including code,
    templates, documentation, installer and panel. "Licensors": IdeasDevOps
    and Disruptia AI. "Internal business purposes": use by you or your
    organization to run your own activity, including employees and
    contractors working for it; it does not include making it available to
    third parties.

Partner and commercial licenses: https://ideasdevops.com
